If you want to listen, please hit the like button!

62
00:06:41,228 --> 00:06:45,328
グッドボタンを押してほしいのじゃ、プリーズ！
Please press the good button, please!

63
00:06:45,725 --> 00:06:50,158
押してほしいのじゃ、お願いしまーすのじゃ！
I want you to press it, please!

64
00:06:50,575 --> 00:06:56,708
